    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Crew Type (Bad Eden): Ironbound Ascendants.</em></p><p><strong>“Height is not terrain. It is policy.”</strong></p><p>Ironbound Ascendants make strongholds out of bad footing and turn cliffs into arguments. They understand supply lines, choke valleys, and the spiritual value of making your enemies climb tired. If a mountain matters, they intend to own the meaning of it.</p><ul><li><strong>Tactical Identity:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Athletics and Athletics.</li><li><strong>Strategic Identity:</strong> Your faction starts with +1 Logistics OPs.</li></ul>",
